BASEDOF="Void"
DESCRIPTION="Lightweight, fast and minimalist Linux distribution based on Void Linux with vanilla Xfce desktop"
HOMEPAGE="https://t4n-labs.github.io/t4n-os"
CREDENTIALS="anon:voidlinux,root:voidlinux"
